        {
          "text": " Omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na bina, muryagira obungyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho, mumare ebiro mushanju nimurya omugaati ogutatumbisiibwe. ",
